        <p>Our returns information.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">

<div class="container">

    <div class="content-block">

        <h2>Return Policy</h2>

        <p>
            We want you to be satisfied with your STREETKICKS purchase.
            If you need to return an item, please contact our customer
            support team before sending the product back.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="content-block">

        <h2>Return Requirements</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>The product should be unused.</li>
            <li>The sneakers should be in their original condition.</li>
            <li>Original packaging should be retained where possible.</li>
            <li>Proof of purchase may be required.</li>
        </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="content-block">

        <h2>How to Request a Return</h2>

        <ol>
            <li>Contact STREETKICKS customer support.</li>
            <li>Provide your order details.</li>
            <li>Explain the reason for the return.</li>
            <li>Follow the return instructions provided by our team.</li>
        </ol>

    </div>

    <div class="content-block">

        <h2>Questions?</h2>

        <p>
            If you have questions about a return, please visit our
            <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> page.
        </p>

    </div>

</div>

